      "description": "CINEWORLD APP \nThe Cineworld app is perfect for the regular cinema goer! Check your local film \ntimes, find your closest Cineworld, purchase cinema tickets, and store your e-tickets\nstraight in the app to make your next Cineworld visit as easy as possible. \nBROWSE MOVIES ON THE CINEWORLD APP \n• Discover What’s On at Cineworld right now \n• Browse current and upcoming movie releases\n• Tap on film posters to watch trailers and read more about the films\nFIND NEARBY CINEWORLD CINEMA LOCATIONS\n• Easily search for nearby Cineworld cinemas \n• Save your local Cineworld under “Favourites” to book faster\n• Get directions to the cinema \nGET FILM TIMES AND BUY MOVIE TICKETS INSTANTLY\n• Find out the film times at nearby Cineworld cinema(s)\n• Purchase movie tickets instantly\n• Get easy access to e-tickets stored in the app so you don’t have to collect tickets\nUPGRADE YOUR EXPERIENCE\n• Choose by special format to experience IMAX, 4DX, ScreenX, Superscreen or ViP\n• Experience films to the fullest on our huge IMAX screens\n• Let motion, wind, water, scent & more thrill you in your seat with 4DX\n• Go beyond the frame with our 270-degree ScreenX \n• Discover our Superscreen where movies feel like masterpieces\nBECOME A MY CINEWORLD MEMBER\n• Sign up to My Cineworld straight from the app \nWe are constantly looking to improve our app, so please keep sending feedback and\nsuggestions through: https://www.cineworld.com/help-and-contact us!\n----------------\nBy downloading, installing and using this App, you agree to Cineworld Cinemas \nPrivacy Policy and Terms of Use",
